OL,3,GNEWSAStretch of M60 closed following
OL,4,Apolice incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M60 was closed after a
OL,7,Fpolice incident lead to part of the
OL,8,Froute being shut in both directions,
OL,9,Fcausing long rush-hour delays.
OL,11,FDrivers were warned to expect delays of
OL,12,Fmore than 30 minutes after a stretch of
OL,13,Fthe motorway was closed between
OL,14,FJunction 17 at Prestwich and Junction
OL,15,F18 at Simister Island.
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Police were at the
OL,18,Fscene alongside North West Ambulance
OL,19,FService and fire crews, National
OL,20,FHighways said.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
