OL,3,GNEWSAStretch of M60 closed following
OL,4,Apolice incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement released after 07:45
OL,7,FBST, the force said it had been
OL,8,Fresponding to concerns for a woman's
OL,9,Fwelfare but she was safe and the road
OL,10,Fwas reopened shortly afterwards.
